          "snippet": {
            "line": 582,
            "text": "theorem extended_flux_zero {h C : ℝ} (s : Scheme S h C) (hI : Icc (-1 : ℝ) 1 ⊆ S)\n    (hbase : s.base.beta = betaFromU s.domain 0 s.base.axial)\n    {p : ℝ × ℝ} (hX : 0 ≤ p.1) (heta : |p.2| ≤ 1) :\n    p.1 * extendedCoefficient s hI 0 2 p =\n      SlowDivergence.radialFlux h 0 (extendedCoefficient s hI 0 1) p"
